     reels stay in a single left-to-right row at every width. Shrink the type
     instead of wrapping — the row IS the hierarchy. */
@media(max-width:640px){
  /* the lever lies on its side under the reels; the arm sweeps left-to-right so it
     still reads as a pull rather than a squash */
  .machine{padding:48px 20px 20px}
