/* ---- one live line, the method in a drawer ----
   The prose under these charts was five paragraphs with four live numbers buried in it,
   which is a methodology page wearing a caption's clothes. The numbers that CHANGE are
   the ones a reader needs without clicking; the method does not change between loads.

   ⚠️ The drawer is closed by default an